    description: "INV-zuhub item 1, edge-type family 'references'. 7 linkers emit references edges. Preliminary audit shows three have short-name resolution patterns and likely need conformance work:\n\n- linkers/di_resolution.py: _get_method_short_name (line 537) + impl_by_short[_get_method_short_name(m.name)] (line 586) — DI method resolution by short name. Almost certainly has a fallback decision.\n- linkers/orm.py:89-91: short_name = sym.name.split('.')[-1]; lookup by short_name — ORM relationship resolution by short name.\n- linkers/react_component.py:213-214: simple_name from component_name; component_map.get(simple_name) — React component reference resolution.\n\nOther four (database_query, middleware_chain, router_routes, websocket) need detailed audit — preliminary grep showed no obvious short-name patterns but a full code read is needed before concluding vacuous.\n\nFor each linker with a fallback decision: thread is_fallback through the resolver, set conf<=0.5 + meta[disambiguation_fallback]=True at edge-creation, add the three property tests (test_references_prefers_imported_*, test_references_same_file_preferred_over_other_file, test_references_deterministic_fallback_when_ambiguous) — see linkers/inheritance.py:209-263 and tests/test_inheritance_linker.py:243-330 for the canonical conforming pattern.\n\nParent: INV-zuhub. Pre-condition: commit dd2a93550e."  # c0d9
    fields: {}  # c0d9
