  message: "Shipped via PR merged to commit 6199c54008 (2026-05-11). 4 linkers brought into INV-zuhub item 1 conformance: orm.py, database_query.py, di_resolution.py (di_registers), react_component.py. 12 new property tests across the four linkers (3 each: single-candidate-precision, same-file-preferred or no-same-file-branch, deterministic-fallback-with-flag). 223 existing + new tests passing. L4 fallback-coherence gate (PR dd2a93550e) continues to pass — every site that sets meta['disambiguation_fallback']=True also sets confidence <= 0.5 in the same Edge.create call.\n\n3 of the 7 references-emitting linkers were vacuous-conformance (middleware_chain: list-based direct refs; router_routes: span-enclosure based; websocket: file_id + synthetic id) — no short-name fallback paths to gate. Documented in the audit notes for completeness."  # d697
